li>个人非商业用途授权</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">PSD / AI / Figma 源文件</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">无水印下载</li>\n        <li class=\"off\">优先客服支持</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 专业版 -->\n    <article class=\"plan plan-featured\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">最受欢迎</span>\n      <div class=\"plan-head\">\n        <h2>专业版</h2>\n        <p class=\"plan-desc\">为独立设计师与自由职业者打造</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"price\">\n        <span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\" data-monthly=\"68\" data-yearly=\"48\">48</span><span class=\"per\">/ 月</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"price-note\" data-monthly=\"按月计费，随时取消\" data-yearly=\"按年计费 ¥576，立省 ¥240\">按年计费 ¥576，立省 ¥240</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" href=\"#\">开始 7 天免费试用</a>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li><b>无限</b>下载全站素材</li>\n        <li>全部高级素材、字体与模板</li>\n        <li>4K 及原始分辨率</li>\n        <li>个人商业用途授权</li>\n        <li>PSD / AI / Figma 源文件</li>\n        <li>无水印下载</li>\n        <li>AI 智能抠图与扩图（每月 200 次）</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n\n    <!-- 团队版 -->\n    <article class=\"plan\">\n      <div class=\"plan-head\">\n        <h2>团队版</h2>\n        <p class=\"plan-desc\">面向设计团队与企业协作</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"price\">\n        <span class=\"currency\">¥</span><span class=\"amount\" data-monthly=\"128\" data-yearly=\"88\">88</span><span class=\"per\">/ 人·月</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"price-note\" data-monthly=\"3 人起订，按月计费\" data-yearly=\"3 人起订，按年计费\">3 人起订，按年计费</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-dark btn-block\" href=\"#\">联系销售</a>\n      <ul class=\"features\">\n        <li>包含专业版全部功能</li>\n        <li>团队共享素材库与收藏夹</li>\n        <li>企业级商业授权（含印刷、广告）</li>\n        <li>成员管理与权限分配</li>\n        <li>统一开具增值税发票</li>\n        <li>AI 工具<b>不限次数</b></li>\n        <li>专属客户经理 · 7×24 支持</li>\n      </ul>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"compare wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">功能详细对比</h2>\n    <div class=\"table-scroll\">\n      <table